@startuml
title C15 menu rendering and execution
' Traces: OMCT-C15-L2-03.03, OMCT-C15-L2-03.04
actor Operator
participant "MenuService" as MenuService
participant "MenuComponent" as Menu
participant "SuperMenuComponent" as SuperMenu
participant "Action callback" as Callback

Operator -> MenuService: show menu at screen coordinate
activate MenuService
MenuService -> Menu: render actions at coordinate
activate Menu
Menu --> MenuService: menu rendered
deactivate Menu
MenuService --> Operator: display menu
deactivate MenuService

Operator -> SuperMenu: pointer focus on menu item
activate SuperMenu
SuperMenu -> SuperMenu: calculate configured placement
SuperMenu -> SuperMenu: display item description
SuperMenu --> Operator: show description and placed menu
deactivate SuperMenu

Operator -> Menu: click menu item
activate Menu
Menu -> Callback: invoke selected action
activate Callback
Callback --> Menu: callback complete
deactivate Callback
Menu -> MenuService: dismiss menu
activate MenuService
MenuService --> Menu: dismissed
deactivate MenuService
Menu --> Operator: menu closed
deactivate Menu
@enduml
